    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20010" root="سفل" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَافِلَةٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُفْلٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  [Hence,] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَافِلَةُ الرُّمْحِ</span>
<i>half that is next to the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زُجّ</span> [or <i>pointed iron shoe,</i>
or <i>foot,</i>] <i>of the spear:</i> (M, K:) [opposed to
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَالِيَتُهُ</span>.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">السَّافِلَةُ</span> <i>The bottom, podex, posteriors,</i> or <i>buttocks;</i> and <i>the anus;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">المَقْعَدَةُ</span>,
(S,) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الدُّبُرُ</span>; (TA;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">السَّفِلَةُ</span></b> ; syn.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الدُّبُرُ</span>. (L in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خجر</span>.)

